# Build artifacts
*.o
*.d
*.a
build/
bencsynth
bencsynth-test
bencsynth-render
*.exe

# Rendered audio. Reproducible from the source that made it, so a build's
# output does not belong in history - regenerate with `make render`. The one
# exception is the demo under docs/, which is committed on purpose: it is how
# someone decides whether to download anything at all, and a link to a CI
# artifact expires after ninety days.
*.wav
!docs/bencsynth-demo.wav

# Saved racks are a person's work, not the project's.
patches/

# Third-party libraries built or copied in locally. raylib is a build
# dependency, not part of this project's source - see the Makefile for how it
# is found, and README.md for how to put one here.
vendor/

# Brand/style assets, kept out of the public repo.
style/

# Screenshots the program writes for itself.
shots/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
._*
